  "status": "completed",
  "output": "apply_patch did not succeed on the first attempt, and the file is unchanged.\n\nWhat happened:\n- I read `trail-notes.md` and confirmed line 6 is `Day 4: Valley exit — 11 km, easy`.\n- My first apply_patch call (with the correct hunk) was denied before it reached the file.\n\nExact error message received:\n\n```\n[Blocked by policy] tool denied by policy\n```\n\nThe message also included the line `Next: Review workspace policies and restrictions`. I did not retry, because policy denials are non-retryable and I must not bypass safeguards; the failure was not a patch-content mismatch.\n\nCurrent state: `trail-notes.md` still reads `Day 4: Valley exit — 11 km, easy` (verified with `cat` after the denial). No files were changed.\n\nTo proceed, the workspace policy needs to allow `apply_patch` (or you can grant edit permission). Once that is in place, I will re-run the same patch, which changes only the trailing word on the Day 4 line to `moderate`.",
